OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: experimental Multiview for up to four cameras, LEVEL roll and tilt meters with Double-tap Level, and Osmo Action 6 support (not yet checked on a real Action 6). Live View no longer crashes on some screen sizes, Nano no longer shows zoom controls, clip delete in playback works again, and Live View uses about 65% less CPU. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
